  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows methylprednisolone acetate injection current since 2021-12-15 with multiple manufacturers; the 20 mg/mL 5 mL vial at Corvale East has 2.7 days on hand and Corvale General has 22.8 days",
  "headline_cites": ["E27", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list for methylprednisolone acetate injection shows Current status first posted 2021-12-15 for Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Eugia US LLC, Par Health USA LLC, Pfizer Inc., and Sagent Pharmaceuticals.",
      "cites": ["E22", "E23", "E24", "E25", "E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 58 months.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 20 mg/mL 5 mL vial (NDC 0009-0274-01) used at Corvale East and Corvale General is labeled by Pharmacia & Upjohn Company LLC (FEI 1810189).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E6", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1208260 at that plant ended 2023-06-16 and was classified VAI; the classification letter was issued 2024-09-10, 548 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 16 vials of the 20 mg/mL 5 mL presentation at 6 vials per day, giving 2.7 days on hand; Corvale General holds 158 vials at 6.9 per day, giving 22.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked transfer option moves 61 vials of 20 mg/mL 5 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with two weeks of supply and bring Corvale East to 13 days.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
